{"seq":3,"slug":"quote-validity-price-lock","title":"报价有效期与价格锁定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-in-exchange-program/used-tradein-valuation/quote-validity-price-lock","wordCount":2303,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"报价有效期与价格锁定\">报价有效期与价格锁定</h1><p>报价页面上的数字一旦生成，就带上了时间属性：它对应的是「今天这个型号在二手市场上的价格」。三天后用户才下单，这个数字还成立吗？如果成立，谁承担这三天里价格下跌的损失；如果不成立，用户在报价页看到的东西就只是一张随时作废的便条。价格锁定要解决的就是这个矛盾——它本质上是平台向用户卖出的一份极短期看跌期权，而这份期权的成本必须被计价，而不是被忽略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-报价的三段生命周期\">核心概念：报价的三段生命周期</h2><p>一份报价从生成到最终核销，会经过三个语义完全不同的阶段。把它们混成一个状态是大规模对账问题的源头。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; Quoted: 估价模型输出&#10;  Quoted --&gt; Locked: 用户下单并占用抵扣&#10;  Quoted --&gt; Expired: 超过有效期未下单&#10;  Locked --&gt; Consumed: 订单支付完成&#10;  Locked --&gt; Released: 订单取消/超时释放&#10;  Consumed --&gt; Regraded: 旧品到检&#10;  Regraded --&gt; Settled: 差异结算完成&#10;  Expired --&gt; [*]&#10;  Released --&gt; [*]&#10;  Settled --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; Quoted: 估价模型输出\n  Quoted --&gt; Locked: 用户下单并占用抵扣\n  Quoted --&gt; Expired: 超过有效期未下单\n  Locked --&gt; Consumed: 订单支付完成\n  Locked --&gt; Released: 订单取消/超时释放\n  Consumed --&gt; Regraded: 旧品到检\n  Regraded --&gt; Settled: 差异结算完成\n  Expired --&gt; [*]\n  Released --&gt; [*]\n  Settled --&gt; [*]</pre><p><strong>Quoted</strong> 是报价生成后的自由有效状态。它的价格按生成时刻的市场基准价计算，有效期由报价时的模型置信度决定（宽区间的报价有效期更短，见 <a href=\"quote-confidence-adjust\">估价置信度与到检调整</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>Locked</strong> 是用户已将其用于一笔具体订单的状态。此时这个数字从「参考价」变成了「承诺价」——平台已经按它计算了订单应付金额，用户也据此做出了购买决策。价格锁定发生在这个跃迁上，而不是在 Quoted 阶段。</p>\n<p>锁定期必须有一个<strong>可执行的截止时点</strong>，而不只是一个天数说明。行业内的做法是把「旧设备必须在收到新设备后若干天内送达」写成硬性条款，例如 Apple 的换新流程要求换新设备在收到新设备起 14 天内送达 Apple，且状态须与描述一致（<a href=\"https://www.apple.com/shop/trade-in\">Apple Trade In</a>）。这个期限与报价有效期是两个不同的时钟：报价有效期约束的是「下单前价格是否还成立」，送达期限约束的是「下单后用户是否履行了承诺」，两者在系统里必须分别建模。</p>\n<p><strong>Consumed → Regraded → Settled</strong> 是第三章的领地：锁定并支付后，旧品寄回、验机、按实检差异结算。本篇只负责把「锁定」这个点定义清楚，不重复结算逻辑。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>价格语义</th>\n<th>谁承担价格风险</th>\n<th>可否被改写</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Quoted</td>\n<td>参考价</td>\n<td>平台（若未锁定）</td>\n<td>可随基准价重算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Locked</td>\n<td>承诺价</td>\n<td>平台（已锁定）</td>\n<td>仅受校验结果影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Consumed</td>\n<td>已计入订单</td>\n<td>已转移进订单</td>\n<td>不可改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Regraded</td>\n<td>实检价</td>\n<td>用户/平台按差异分摊</td>\n<td>按规则结算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"有效期的定长与定价\">有效期的定长与定价</h2><p>有效期不是一个运营随手定的天数，它应当从「模型置信度」和「基准价的日波动率」两个量推出来。基准价日波动越大的型号，锁价成本越高，有效期应越短。</p>\n<p>锁价成本可以这样估计。设型号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 的基准价日对数波动率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，锁定时长为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 天，锁价价格相对当前基准价的偏离度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>。那么在锁定期内基准价跌破锁定价超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 的概率近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>loss</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>δ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><msqrt><mi>T</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{loss}} \\approx \\Phi\\!\\left(-\\frac{\\delta}{\\sigma_m \\sqrt{T}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">loss</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4167em;vertical-align:-0.9667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Φ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1833em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9667em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>平台的期望锁价成本是这个概率乘以超过部分的期望跌幅，再乘以该型号的历史换新量。这个公式的实用价值不在于精确，而在于它给出了正确的<strong>单调性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越大、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 越长、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 越小，锁价成本越高。据此可以给每个型号分档：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>档位</th>\n<th>型号特征</th>\n<th>典型日波动</th>\n<th>建议锁价天数</th>\n<th>允许偏离上限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>热销新机</td>\n<td>上市 12 个月内</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>3–5 天</td>\n<td>小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稳定期机型</td>\n<td>上市 1–3 年</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>7–14 天</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长尾机型</td>\n<td>上市 3 年以上</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>14–30 天</td>\n<td>大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意「允许偏离上限」这一列的方向：热销新机反而给更小的偏离容忍度，因为它的价格最可能在锁价窗口内剧烈变动。这个设计与直觉相反但正确。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 报价锁价：以乐观并发控制防止同一报价被两次订单占用&#10;UPDATE tradein_quotes&#10;SET status = &#39;LOCKED&#39;,&#10;    locked_order_id = :order_id,&#10;    locked_at = now(),&#10;    lock_expires_at = now() + make_interval(days =&gt; :lock_days)&#10;WHERE quote_id = :quote_id&#10;  AND status = &#39;QUOTED&#39;&#10;  AND expires_at &gt; now()&#10;  AND locked_order_id IS NULL&#10;RETURNING quote_id, quote_price_cents;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 报价锁价：以乐观并发控制防止同一报价被两次订单占用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tradein_quotes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'LOCKED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    locked_order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :order_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    locked_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lock_expires_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> make_interval(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">days</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :lock_days)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quote_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :quote_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'QUOTED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expires_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> locked_order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RETURNING quote_id, quote_price_cents;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>WHERE status = &#39;QUOTED&#39; ... AND locked_order_id IS NULL</code> 是这段 SQL 的关键：它把「报价只能被一个订单锁定」这条不变式交给数据库而不是应用层判重。并发的两个结算请求里只会有一个 <code>UPDATE</code> 影响一行，另一个返回空结果集。这比先 <code>SELECT</code> 再 <code>UPDATE</code> 安全得多。</p>\n<h3 id=\"锁价的两种实现口径\">锁价的两种实现口径</h3><p>平台可以选择两种口径，它们的会计后果不同。</p>\n<p><strong>硬锁定</strong>：锁定那一刻起，无论基准价如何变化，结算时都使用锁定价。用户侧体验最好，平台承担全部下行风险。适合作为高价值会员权益或大促期间的标准做法。</p>\n<p><strong>软锁定</strong>：锁定价只作为<strong>报价展示上限</strong>，实际结算按「锁定时的价格与结算时基准价取低者」执行。它对平台更友好，但必须把规则写进用户可见条款，否则构成误导。软锁定在价格上行期对用户有利、下行期对平台有利，长期的公平性依赖于规则透明。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;lock_policy&quot;: &quot;hard&quot;,&#10;  &quot;lock_days&quot;: 7,&#10;  &quot;lock_price_cents&quot;: 33106,&#10;  &quot;buffer_pct&quot;: 0.06,&#10;  &quot;base_price_at_lock&quot;: 41200,&#10;  &quot;regrade_floor_pct&quot;: 0.5,&#10;  &quot;notes&quot;: &quot;锁价为承诺价；到检差异仍按特征级规则下调，但下调后不得低于锁价的 50%&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"lock_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hard\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"lock_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"lock_price_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">33106</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"buffer_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.06</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"base_price_at_lock\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">41200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"regrade_floor_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"notes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"锁价为承诺价；到检差异仍按特征级规则下调，但下调后不得低于锁价的 50%\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>regrade_floor_pct</code> 是锁价与到检调整之间必须显式约定的一条边界规则。锁价承诺的是「价格不因市场变化而下调」，而不是「价格不因到检差异而下调」；到检差异是另一回事，但如果完全没有下限，用户会感觉锁价形同虚设。设一个保底比例（例如到检价不低于锁价的 50%）能在两者之间取得可解释的平衡，超出的部分走复核或平台兜底。</p>\n<h2 id=\"锁价与抵扣额度的耦合\">锁价与抵扣额度的耦合</h2><p>锁价一旦发生，这笔金额就要在订单里被占用成一项抵扣，而这会引出额度问题：同一个用户能否同时锁定多笔报价？同一台设备能否在多个渠道分别报价并锁定？这两个问题的答案决定第二章抵扣入账的实现方式。</p>\n<p>成对的约束应当这样设计。<strong>同一设备唯一</strong>：报价绑定设备的唯一标识（序列号或 IMEI），同一标识在同一时间只能有一个 Locked 报价，重复锁定请求返回已有锁价。<strong>同一用户限额</strong>：一个用户可同时锁定的报价数量与总金额设上限，避免恶意用户批量锁价占额。这两条约束的落库方式是在报价表上建部分唯一索引：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE UNIQUE INDEX uniq_active_lock_per_device&#10;  ON tradein_quotes (device_identity_hash)&#10;  WHERE status = &#39;LOCKED&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uniq_active_lock_per_device</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tradein_quotes (device_identity_hash)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'LOCKED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>部分唯一索引（<code>WHERE</code> 子句限定索引范围）是这里最合适的工具：它只约束活跃锁价，历史记录不受影响，也无需在应用层做分布式锁。</p>\n<h3 id=\"锁价释放\">锁价释放</h3><p>锁价必须有明确的释放路径，否则额度会被永久占用。三条释放路径：订单取消触发释放、锁价到期未使用触发释放、以及支付完成把 Locked 转成 Consumed。释放动作本身必须是幂等的——重复释放不产生额外副作用，也不改变已进入后续流程的报价状态。释放后的报价回到 Quoted 还是直接 Expired，取决于基准价是否已经漂移：若漂移超过保护带，直接作废并提示重新估价，避免用户拿着一份过期价格下单。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时效与跨境结算的交互\">时效与跨境结算的交互</h2><p>跨境换新里还有一个额外维度：报价货币与结算货币不一致时，锁价必须同时锁定汇率口径。否则「价格锁定了但汇率没锁」，用户在结算日仍会看到金额变化，投诉的归因也会混乱。稳妥做法是把锁价记录里的汇率作为一个独立字段冻结，并在到期释放时一并作废；若平台愿意承担汇率风险，则把汇率保护带纳入锁价成本计算，与型号波动率一起决定有效的锁价天数。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[报价生成] --&gt; B{置信度档位}&#10;  B --&gt;|高| T1[锁价 7-14 天]&#10;  B --&gt;|低| T2[锁价 3-5 天]&#10;  T1 --&gt; C[冻结价格 + 冻结汇率]&#10;  T2 --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt; D[订单占用抵扣额度]&#10;  D --&gt; E{订单是否成立}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[Consumed 进入验机流程]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[幂等释放 + 按漂移决定是否作废]\">graph TD\n  A[报价生成] --&gt; B{置信度档位}\n  B --&gt;|高| T1[锁价 7-14 天]\n  B --&gt;|低| T2[锁价 3-5 天]\n  T1 --&gt; C[冻结价格 + 冻结汇率]\n  T2 --&gt; C\n  C --&gt; D[订单占用抵扣额度]\n  D --&gt; E{订单是否成立}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[Consumed 进入验机流程]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[幂等释放 + 按漂移决定是否作废]</pre><p>这张图把本篇的结论落成了可实现的时序：置信度决定锁价时长，锁价同时冻结价格与汇率，占用额度后由订单的成立与否决定去向，释放路径必须幂等。第二章的抵扣入账就建立在这条时序之上（见 <a href=\"../tradein-order-link/tradein-credit-new-order\">换新抵扣与新品订单联动</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>报价分 Quoted / Locked / Consumed / Regraded 四段语义，价格锁定发生在 Quoted→Locked 的跃迁上。</li>\n<li>有效期应从基准价日波动率与锁价偏离度推出，而非按运营习惯定；型号波动越大，锁价越短、偏离容忍越小。</li>\n<li>硬锁定承诺「不因市场变化下调」，软锁定取低者结算，两者都必须写进可见条款。</li>\n<li>锁价必须约定与到检调整的边界（如保底比例），否则用户会把两者混为一谈。</li>\n<li>「同一设备唯一活跃锁价」用部分唯一索引在数据库层保证；释放路径必须幂等。</li>\n<li>跨境场景下锁价要同时冻结汇率，否则锁价承诺在结算日失效。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"报价有效期与价格锁定","id":"报价有效期与价格锁定"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：报价的三段生命周期","id":"核心概念-报价的三段生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"有效期的定长与定价","id":"有效期的定长与定价"},{"level":3,"text":"锁价的两种实现口径","id":"锁价的两种实现口径"},{"level":2,"text":"锁价与抵扣额度的耦合","id":"锁价与抵扣额度的耦合"},{"level":3,"text":"锁价释放","id":"锁价释放"},{"level":2,"text":"时效与跨境结算的交互","id":"时效与跨境结算的交互"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"估价置信度与到检调整","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-in-exchange-program/used-tradein-valuation/quote-confidence-adjust"},"next":{"title":"换新抵扣与新品订单联动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-in-exchange-program/tradein-order-link/tradein-credit-new-order"}}